function insertNode(type:string,attrs:Record<string,unknown>={},content?:any[]){const node={type,attrs:{id:newId(type),...attrs},...(content?{content}:{})},e=editor.value;if(!e)return;const selection=e.state.selection;if(selection instanceof NodeSelection)e.chain().focus().insertContentAt(selection.to,node).run();else command('insertContent',node);}
